## Requirements

- A Linux or macOS control node with `ansible-core` >= 2.15
- Public-key SSH access to the target machines, with the `[[ domain.remote_user ]]`
  account on port [[ domain.ssh_port ]]
[% if domain.become %]
- `sudo` access on the target machines
[% endif %]

Installing the dependencies:

```bash
[% if domain.collections %]
ansible-galaxy collection install -r requirements.yml
[% else %]
# No external collection required: everything relies on ansible.builtin.
[% endif %]
```

